{"about_the_game":"You're a small box, and you can travel the world! <br>The map of the level keeps coming, and you can explore in the ocean of pixels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b89ce3712438a88099828b36b8e871ae.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b89ce3712438a88099828b36b8e871ae.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b89ce3712438a88099828b36b8e871ae.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Breaking Box&quot; is an interactive game where players create their own level content. <br>You can become any field you want!<br>Become a level master, conquer the level world, or get first place in endless mode.<br>Become a racing king, racing against time in the leaderboard or ultra-difficult levels.<br>Become a game level designer, using the level editor to create your own unique levels.<br>Become the best partner or worst enemy, spending a pleasant time online.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge and race, try your best</h2>Want to rack your brains to solve challenging levels? <br>Or compete against the clock in ultra-difficult levels with every second counting?<br> Haha, all to satisfy you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/c02901bc7265144666c87b66e12408a9.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/c02901bc7265144666c87b66e12408a9.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/c02901bc7265144666c87b66e12408a9.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>World challenge mode, big adventure in a small world, with over a hundred selected levels to conquer one after another. Stay tuned for more worlds to come.<br>Endless challenge mode, with massive self-made levels of random difficulty. If you want to be remembered, conquer more levels.<br>Only up mode, climb to the top on a large map with no chance for error. If you slip, game over. See who can jump well.<br>Can't pass a level? Too slow? Shadow mode can help you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b8dbc5635c5e3b392920f0a0631004ad.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b8dbc5635c5e3b392920f0a0631004ad.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b8dbc5635c5e3b392920f0a0631004ad.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether it's a matter of quantity or time, a test of intelligence or skills, believe in yourself, you can do it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor, create your own maps</h2><br>Have a great idea? Want to create your own game? Aha,just try the level editor!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/01ff090e27dd95897c0eaa521a382d03.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>It's easy to get started. You're in charge of everything, from tiles, props, creatures, and background... and more props are still in the works!<br>Whether you prefer solo or multiplayer, puzzle or racing, it's up to you. You can create a map and enjoy the scenery as well!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/f4dc546f2111e4e034034b68cb59c0c4.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Feeling tired from map-making? Import map templates and stitch together your creativity to make increasingly challenging maps for endless fun!<br>Upload your self-made maps to the server, create a room, and share your creativity with other players!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer online rooms, collaboration or competition</h2>The game supports online multiplayer for 2-8 players and local multiplayer for 2-4 players.<br>With modes such as reaching the finish line, collecting coins, minimizing errors, variety, and collaboration, there's always a mode that suits you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/56b6df18353cd420c9d4310b06e3639a.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=598 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/56b6df18353cd420c9d4310b06e3639a.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/56b6df18353cd420c9d4310b06e3639a.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Push your friends forward, knock your opponents down, friendship first, competition second.<br>Collaborate to decrypt, help each other, communicate with your eyes, and unite as one.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/cb6057014c28a32aa1fc5968105673ba.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/cb6057014c28a32aa1fc5968105673ba.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/cb6057014c28a32aa1fc5968105673ba.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Come and have fun with your buddies, challenging levels in different modes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Numerous Skins to Create Your Favorite Character</h2>Beef Burger, Moonlight Warrior, Fat Kitty, Silly Corgis... all kinds of skins for you!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/16178ac04f9b5d59eb31894d40cbcd9a.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/16178ac04f9b5d59eb31894d40cbcd9a.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Journey in a Playful Fantasy World</h2>Float in the space with the moon smiling at you. Clashing with each other in an arena made of clouds.<br>Pigeon that faints. Robot vacuum that shows affections. Vanishing kitty floors... It's such a fantasy world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/5a0ee9e5d168ca2899849d290fe28c5a.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/5a0ee9e5d168ca2899849d290fe28c5a.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/5a0ee9e5d168ca2899849d290fe28c5a.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8db6dd8746152722482c5800a0cb0e6f1edc685d.jpg","localized_name":"Used to it","name":"Used to it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/8db6dd8746152722482c5800a0cb0e6f1edc685d.jpg"},{"icon":"15b2a4ab89f218dede33b84a6d13525641ae4e05.jpg","localized_name":"Serenity","name":"Serenity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/15b2a4ab89f218dede33b84a6d13525641ae4e05.jpg"},{"icon":"780ae230d8315efca0dcc5d59af6981a2937acaa.jpg","localized_name":"Highlight moment","name":"Highlight moment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/780ae230d8315efca0dcc5d59af6981a2937acaa.jpg"},{"icon":"35b44256aa85eec512dce95e16076ab1f8e683df.jpg","localized_name":"Raise your eyebrows","name":"Raise your eyebrows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/35b44256aa85eec512dce95e16076ab1f8e683df.jpg"},{"icon":"2daefde876ffef0bbb9b908d6b8800bdefec95e0.jpg","localized_name":"Traveller","name":"Traveller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/2daefde876ffef0bbb9b908d6b8800bdefec95e0.jpg"},{"icon":"dd667139d1723de635c739d9a38cb2f758239e09.jpg","localized_name":"Expert","name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/dd667139d1723de635c739d9a38cb2f758239e09.jpg"},{"icon":"6f37ffe03773bd26dafcd5ea71e1acc6767ce044.jpg","localized_name":"Knowledgeable","name":"Knowledgeable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/6f37ffe03773bd26dafcd5ea71e1acc6767ce044.jpg"},{"icon":"7f69c591b31f6f6d436ee42204aa2ea710a4a02e.jpg","localized_name":"Sophisticate","name":"Sophisticate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/7f69c591b31f6f6d436ee42204aa2ea710a4a02e.jpg"},{"icon":"aca52b49989af3ac5c02b948f10e7ff5c11d0285.jpg","localized_name":"Ordinary","name":"Ordinary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/aca52b49989af3ac5c02b948f10e7ff5c11d0285.jpg"},{"icon":"fc78cef80c73b2f7913643d8fa46f0957548c150.jpg","localized_name":"Hard power","name":"Hard power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1077510/fc78cef80c73b2f7913643d8fa46f0957548c150.jpg"}],"total":88},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1077510?t=1694576544","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1077510?t=1694576544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1694576544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1694576544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1717630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Contact Us</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>You're a small box, and you can travel the world! <br>The map of the level keeps coming, and you can explore in the ocean of pixels!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b89ce3712438a88099828b36b8e871ae.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b89ce3712438a88099828b36b8e871ae.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b89ce3712438a88099828b36b8e871ae.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Breaking Box&quot; is an interactive game where players create their own level content. <br>You can become any field you want!<br>Become a level master, conquer the level world, or get first place in endless mode.<br>Become a racing king, racing against time in the leaderboard or ultra-difficult levels.<br>Become a game level designer, using the level editor to create your own unique levels.<br>Become the best partner or worst enemy, spending a pleasant time online.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge and race, try your best</h2>Want to rack your brains to solve challenging levels? <br>Or compete against the clock in ultra-difficult levels with every second counting?<br> Haha, all to satisfy you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/c02901bc7265144666c87b66e12408a9.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/c02901bc7265144666c87b66e12408a9.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/c02901bc7265144666c87b66e12408a9.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>World challenge mode, big adventure in a small world, with over a hundred selected levels to conquer one after another. Stay tuned for more worlds to come.<br>Endless challenge mode, with massive self-made levels of random difficulty. If you want to be remembered, conquer more levels.<br>Only up mode, climb to the top on a large map with no chance for error. If you slip, game over. See who can jump well.<br>Can't pass a level? Too slow? Shadow mode can help you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b8dbc5635c5e3b392920f0a0631004ad.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b8dbc5635c5e3b392920f0a0631004ad.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/b8dbc5635c5e3b392920f0a0631004ad.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether it's a matter of quantity or time, a test of intelligence or skills, believe in yourself, you can do it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor, create your own maps</h2><br>Have a great idea? Want to create your own game? Aha,just try the level editor!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/01ff090e27dd95897c0eaa521a382d03.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>It's easy to get started. You're in charge of everything, from tiles, props, creatures, and background... and more props are still in the works!<br>Whether you prefer solo or multiplayer, puzzle or racing, it's up to you. You can create a map and enjoy the scenery as well!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/f4dc546f2111e4e034034b68cb59c0c4.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Feeling tired from map-making? Import map templates and stitch together your creativity to make increasingly challenging maps for endless fun!<br>Upload your self-made maps to the server, create a room, and share your creativity with other players!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer online rooms, collaboration or competition</h2>The game supports online multiplayer for 2-8 players and local multiplayer for 2-4 players.<br>With modes such as reaching the finish line, collecting coins, minimizing errors, variety, and collaboration, there's always a mode that suits you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/56b6df18353cd420c9d4310b06e3639a.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=598 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/56b6df18353cd420c9d4310b06e3639a.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/56b6df18353cd420c9d4310b06e3639a.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Push your friends forward, knock your opponents down, friendship first, competition second.<br>Collaborate to decrypt, help each other, communicate with your eyes, and unite as one.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/cb6057014c28a32aa1fc5968105673ba.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/cb6057014c28a32aa1fc5968105673ba.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/cb6057014c28a32aa1fc5968105673ba.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Come and have fun with your buddies, challenging levels in different modes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Numerous Skins to Create Your Favorite Character</h2>Beef Burger, Moonlight Warrior, Fat Kitty, Silly Corgis... all kinds of skins for you!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/16178ac04f9b5d59eb31894d40cbcd9a.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/16178ac04f9b5d59eb31894d40cbcd9a.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Journey in a Playful Fantasy World</h2>Float in the space with the moon smiling at you. Clashing with each other in an arena made of clouds.<br>Pigeon that faints. Robot vacuum that shows affections. Vanishing kitty floors... It's such a fantasy world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/5a0ee9e5d168ca2899849d290fe28c5a.poster.avif?t=1694576544\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/5a0ee9e5d168ca2899849d290fe28c5a.webm?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/extras/5a0ee9e5d168ca2899849d290fe28c5a.mp4?t=1694576544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Dotoyou Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1077510/header.jpg?t=1694576544","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>",